    "semantic": "\"mark\": making a dirty spot (*cups mark the table*), writing a label (*mark the boxes*), giving a score to schoolwork, and celebrating an event (*mark her birthday*) are unrelated words in many languages. The celebrating sense is often missed: it does not mean *write on*.",
